M1: Medic 29 on scene, staging the stretcher.  >> time:eTimes.06 "on scene"
M2: Temp 91.2, GCS 12, shivering stopped.  >> vital:temp=91.2 "Temp 91.2"; vital:gcs=12 "GCS 12"
TAP button +label
M1: Rate 52, pressure 104 over 64, sugar 58.  >> vital:hr=52 "Rate 52"; vital:bp=104/64 "pressure 104 over 64"; vital:bgl=58 "sugar 58"
TAP button +label
M2: Line in, warm saline.  >> proc:IV access "Line in"; med:normal saline,,, "warm saline"
TAP button +label
M1: Thiamine 100 IV.  >> med:thiamine,100,,IV "Thiamine 100 IV"
TAP button -
GAP 10
M1: D10 250 mLs.  >> med:dextrose,250,mL, "D10 250 mLs"
GAP 12
M2: Sugar 112, GCS 14.  >> vital:bgl=112 "Sugar 112"; vital:gcs=14 "GCS 14"
TAP button -
M1: Medic 29 transporting to County, priority three.  >> time:eTimes.09 "transporting"
M1: County, Medic 29, 55 male found outside, temp 91.2, sugar 58, thiamine 100, D10 250, warming, GCS 14.
M1: Arriving County.  >> time:eTimes.11 "Arriving County"
